sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant HTTP
    participant Kernel
    participant Policy
    participant Lock
    participant Transaction
    participant Database
    participant Outbox

    Browser->>HTTP: Unsafe request + session + CSRF + idempotency key
    HTTP->>Kernel: RequestEnvelope
    Kernel->>Policy: session, origin, CSRF, rate, authorization
    Policy-->>Kernel: allowed
    Kernel->>Lock: acquire renewable lease
    Lock-->>Kernel: lease + fencing token
    Kernel->>Transaction: begin
    Transaction->>Database: optimistic update with revision and fencing token
    Database-->>Transaction: committed row
    Transaction->>Outbox: enqueue event in same transaction
    Transaction-->>Kernel: commit
    Kernel->>Lock: release
    Kernel-->>HTTP: ActionResult
    HTTP-->>Browser: JSON + request ID + rate headers
